**Helpers (slot shape, time, end time):**

```549:575:/home/admin/backend/app/Services/EnrollmentService.php
    private function normalizeDayTimeSlots(array $slots): array
    {
        $result = [];
        foreach ($slots as $slot) {
            $day = (int) ($slot['day'] ?? 0);
            $time = isset($slot['start_time']) ? trim((string) $slot['start_time']) : '';
            if ($day < 1 || $day > 7 || $time === '') {
                continue;
            }
            $result[$day] = $this->normalizeTime(substr($time, 0, 5));
        }
        ksort($result);
        return $result;
    }
    // ...
    private function computeEndTime(string $startTime, int $durationMinutes): string
    {
        return Carbon::createFromFormat('H:i:s', $startTime)
            ->addMinutes($durationMinutes)
            ->format('H:i:s');
    }
```

Every other mention of duration in this file is the same pattern: **`(int) $data['duration_minutes']`** passed into `computeEndTime` (lines 114, 129, 354, 402) and stored on **`StudentClass`** as **`SessionDuration`** (line 305), plus **`TotalHours`** derived from minutes (line 306).

