**Per-row data model:** each logical row corresponds to `{ day, start_time }` in `form.day_time_slots` (synced in script via `syncDaySlotsFromSelection` / `updateDaySlot`). There is **no per-day duration** in the payload—only **global** `duration_minutes` at submit (from `duration_hours`).

